      "content": "i know, i know, i should call the doc but they're super hard to get ahold of and it's the weekend. i've taken sudafed before when i wasn't on the antipsychotics and it was fine. does it actually pose a major risk or is it just a standard precaution? i'm just looking for a quick answer so i can sleep.",
